  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759357,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 11th Annual Vanilla Level Design Contest: The\n\nStep into a fresh and challenging Super Mario World experience crafted entirely by the SMW Central community! \"The\" is a remarkable ROM hack born from the 11th Annual Vanilla Level Design Contest (VLDC), showcasing a collection of meticulously designed levels submitted by talented creators. \n\nForget the familiar Mushroom Kingdom – this is a journey through entirely new worlds, built within the constraints of the original game's engine and limitations (the \"vanilla\" ruleset). Expect innovative level design, clever use of existing mechanics, and a surprising amount of creativity squeezed from the Super Nintendo's hardware. \n\n\"The\" isn't a traditional story-driven adventure; instead, it's a curated anthology of unique challenges. Each level presents a distinct theme and gameplay style, ranging from intricate puzzle rooms to fast-paced action sequences.  Prepare for unexpected twists, demanding platforming, and a constant sense of discovery as you explore the collective vision of the SMW Central community.  A must-play for Super Mario World veterans seeking a revitalized and inventive experience!"
    },
